    "t": "<p>Bestäm ekvationssystemets lösning genom att läsa av linjernas skärningspunkt i grafen.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg width=\"390\" height=\"300\" viewBox=\"0 0 390 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"388\" height=\"298\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"310\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"310\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"274\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"289\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">0</text><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"274\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"289\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">1</text><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"274\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"289\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">2</text><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"274\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"289\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">3</text><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"274\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"289\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">4</text><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"274\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"289\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">5</text><line x1=\"56\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"274\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">0</text><line x1=\"56\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">1</text><line x1=\"56\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"194\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">2</text><line x1=\"56\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">3</text><line x1=\"56\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">4</text><line x1=\"56\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"74\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">5</text><line x1=\"56\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">6</text></svg></span>",
