    "s": "<p>a) \\(2x+3=0\\Rightarrow x=-3/2\\), eller \\(x-4=0\\Rightarrow x=4\\).</p><p>b) \\(5x-10=0\\Rightarrow x=2\\), eller \\(x+1=0\\Rightarrow x=-1\\).</p><p>c) \\(4x+1=0\\Rightarrow x=-1/4\\), eller \\(2x-6=0\\Rightarrow x=3\\).</p>",
