    "t": "<p>Bestäm \\(x\\) om \\(\\lg x=3\\).</p><p><strong>Endast svar.</strong></p>",
    "s": "<p>\\(\\lg x=3\\) betyder per definition att \\(x=10^3\\).</p><p><strong>\\(x=1000\\).</strong></p>",
    "familj": "logaritmbegreppet__bestam_logaritmvarde",
