    "t": "<p>Lös \\(\\sqrt{2x-1}=5\\).</p>",
    "s": "<p>Kvadrera:</p><p>\\(2x-1=25\\Rightarrow2x=26\\).</p><p><strong>\\(x=13\\)</strong></p>",
    "familj": "rotekvationer__isolera_rot_och_kvadrera",
