    "s": "<p>\\(p=-3\\) och \\(q=-10\\).</p><p>\\(x=\\frac32\\pm\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac32\\right)^2+10}=\\frac32\\pm\\frac72\\).</p><p><strong>\\(x=5\\) eller \\(x=-2\\)</strong></p>",
    "familj": "losningsformel_andragrad__losa_med_pq_eller_formel",
