    "kurs": [
      "2b",
      "2c"
    ],
    "niva": "E",
    "poang": "1/0/0",
    "t": "<p>En tabell visar \\(f(-1)=5\\), \\(f(0)=2\\), \\(f(3)=8\\).</p><p>Bestäm \\(f(3)\\).</p>",
    "s": "<p>Tabellen anger direkt att \\(f(3)=8\\).</p><p><strong>8</strong></p>",
