    "niva": "E",
    "poang": "1/0/0",
    "t": "<p>I en triangel gäller \\(DE\\parallel BC\\). \\(AD=4\\), \\(AB=10\\) och \\(AC=15\\). Bestäm \\(AE\\).</p>",
    "s": "<p>Likformighet ger \\(AD/AB=AE/AC\\). Alltså \\(4/10=AE/15\\), så \\(AE=6\\).</p>",
